        "license": "CC-BY-SA-2.0",
        "observed": "Inspected960×720 main facade:three pale onion domes with dark radial inlay stripes,two cylindrical red minarets with narrow pale vertical stripes/projecting collars/open pale cupolas,raised pale-bordered central iwan and five smaller cusped bays on each side. Red crenellations,two small portal chhatris,pale framed rectangular panels and red court. Fine cusps,carving,calligraphy and current finish abstracted or unverified."
