        "author": "Vyacheslav Argenberg",
        "date": "2007-09-27",
        "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
        "observed": "Inspected960×640 court/upper-gate picture:low red arcaded perimeter,tall east and side gatehouses with pointed entry fields/stacked side lights,open upper galleries and slender pale-tipped pinnacles;corner open domed red pavilions. Rectangular water basin has a broad pale rim,four small corner finials and small central side ornaments. Surrounding city and Red Fort remain separate host content."
      },
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20191203_Jama_Masjid,_Delhi_0722_6487_DxO.jpg",
