        "date": "2019-12-03",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
        "observed": "Inspected960×638 east/north enclosure from gallery roof:low open red court arcade and crenellated roof edge,large gatehouses with stacked recessed arch fields/corbelled pale central balcony,open upper arcades and tall slender corner pinnacles. Small pale caps above upper-gallery pavilions. Fine ornament and exact gate gallery partitions are approximations."
      },
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Main_entrance,_and_the_approach_road,_from_the_minaret,_Jama_Masjid,_Delhi.jpg",
