        "date": "2006-07-12",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-2.0",
        "observed": "Inspected500×667 east-gate overview from a minaret:deep rectangular red gateway,three stacked pointed facade fields,corbelled pale center balcony,four tall corner pinnacles and an open upper gallery around the roof. Exterior approach continues beyond the gate;the outside stair treads are not fully resolved in this view. Standard viewer step centerlines supply stair axes/runs;all widths,counts,grades and exact street joins remain approximate."
